s rehabilitation. My job is to help you get the most out of every day. We will have ongoing conversations as things evolve, and you can ask me anything at any time. You are not alone in this.\'\n\n**Key principles**: Ask-Tell-Ask method, truth-telling balanced with realistic hope, focusing on function and quality of life, providing a concrete plan, emotional attunement to both patient and family.',
